{"id":"erledigt","lemma":"erledigt","pos":"adj","rank":675,"glosses":["completed","done for","exhausted"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/De-at-erledigt.ogg/De-at-erledigt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du das schon erledigt?","en":"Have you already done that?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"already"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es schnell erledigt.","en":"I did it quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767536","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"quickly"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin froh, dass das erledigt ist.","en":"I'm glad that's done.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798099","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"glad"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ruf mich, wenn es erledigt ist.","en":"Call me when it's done.","words":[{"g":"to call out","l":"rufen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich hoffe, die Arbeit ist erledigt.","en":"I hope the work is finished.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]}]}